Non-mesh files under .wiki/ (runtime artifacts: index sqlite + sidecars, refresh lock, perf log; and the .gitattributes dotfile) must be excluded from mesh enumeration or the mesh reader fails closed parsing one as a mesh. The store enumerates the artifacts in is_runtime_artifact, writes .wiki/.gitattributes in ensure_wiki_dir, the mesh_scaffold test mirrors the dotfile filter, and .gitignore ignores the same set. Adding or renaming any artifact requires updating all sites in lockstep.
